Kingdom-era border geometry in data/kingdom-eras/geo/*.topo.json is derived from

  historical-basemaps — Andre Ourednik
  https://github.com/aourednik/historical-basemaps

which is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0).
The derived files (clipped to Europe, snapped to Natural Earth coastlines,
re-assigned to Europa Strata polity ids, simplified with mapshaper) are
distributed under the same GPL-3.0 terms. Full licence text:
https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

Coastlines / land: Natural Earth (public domain).
Years without a dataset map (1450, 1750, 1871, 1990) and polities missing from
the dataset use Europa Strata's own hand-drawn approximate outlines (dashed).
Build: scripts/build_era_maps_v2.py (+ scripts/era_maps_v2_overrides.json).
